Merge Sort Runtime Analysis
def merge_sort(arr):
    if len(arr) &lt;= 1:          # O(1)
        return arr
    mid = len(arr) // 2        # O(1)
    left = merge_sort(arr[:mid])    # T(n/2)
    right = merge_sort(arr[mid:])   # T(n/2)
    return merge(left, right)       # O(n)
The recurrence:
\[T(n) = 2T(n/2) + O(n)\]

